<span id="A4.F5.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.F5.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Task:<span id="A4.F5.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> You are a helpful assistant. Below is a categorized list of assistive technologies, organized by type of disability, but not limited to these examples:</span></span></span>
