<span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i2.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The response correctly identifies screen reader compatibility for visually impaired users.</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
