<span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i2.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">It highlights customization options, which benefit users with learning disabilities.</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
</span></span>
<span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"><span id="A6.I4.i2.I1.i3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">–</span></span> 
