<span id="A6.F8.pic1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A6.F8.pic1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">"There are several credit card options available for individuals with mental health and behavioral disorders. However, it’s essential to note that the best option will depend on your individual financial situation, credit score, and needs. Here are some credit cards that offer benefits and resources specifically for mental health and behavioral disorders:</span></span>
